WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 40=

5
02:58.260 --> 03:00.100
(I made)

6
03:01.940 --> 03:03.900
(many mistakes in my life,)

7
03:05.580 --> 03:07.460
(and lost someone along the way.)

8
03:25.780 --> 03:26.900
(But now,)

9
03:28.460 --> 03:29.700
(it's too late for regrets.)

10
03:33.620 --> 03:35.140
(I've roamed half my life,)

11
03:36.540 --> 03:38.180
(and I've only ever surrendered once.)

12
03:39.740 --> 03:40.740
(And that was agreeing)

13
03:41.740 --> 03:42.980
(to be your husband.)

14
04:14.460 --> 04:15.420
(Everything)

15
04:18.740 --> 04:20.980
(can finally come to an end.)

16
05:00.380 --> 05:01.660
Your Royal Highness, Yang Si is dead!

17
05:07.780 --> 05:08.980
Yang Si is dead?

18
05:13.100 --> 05:13.660
That's impossible.

19
05:14.700 --> 05:15.860
It's a trick.

20
05:17.060 --> 05:18.060
It was Mu Wanyao.

21
05:18.940 --> 05:20.220
It's Mu Wanyao lying to me.

22
05:21.180 --> 05:21.700
Yang Si

23
05:23.540 --> 05:24.540
can't be dead.

24
06:00.180 --> 06:00.940
I will

25
06:01.860 --> 06:03.220
take Sheng'an tonight!

26
06:04.220 --> 06:05.460
Only forward.

27
06:06.380 --> 06:07.580
Those who retreat

28
06:08.380 --> 06:09.260
die!

29
06:13.460 --> 06:14.580
We must hold the city!

30
06:18.580 --> 06:19.180
Commander Yan!

31
06:21.340 --> 06:22.060
Commander Yan.

32
06:24.260 --> 06:24.820
Commander Yan.

33
06:24.820 --> 06:25.940
It's really Commander Yan.

34
06:26.100 --> 06:26.420
Commander Yan.

35
06:26.420 --> 06:27.700
He's back. We're saved.

36
06:29.980 --> 06:30.420
Commander Yan!

37
06:31.460 --> 06:32.420
It's really Commander Yan.

38
06:32.700 --> 06:34.180
Now we can hold the city.

39
06:57.580 --> 06:58.580
Commander Yan is still alive?

40
07:10.260 --> 07:10.940
Young man,

41
07:12.340 --> 07:13.180
where are you from?

42
07:13.740 --> 07:14.500
Commander Yan.

43
07:15.220 --> 07:15.820
Longyou Circuit.

44
07:22.180 --> 07:22.580
And you?

45
07:22.820 --> 07:23.700
I'm from Wanlian County.

46
07:25.540 --> 07:26.580
Sizhou, Qianzhong Circuit.

47
07:28.300 --> 07:29.260
I'm from Lyumin!

48
07:30.620 --> 07:31.740
I'm from Shan County!

49
07:34.740 --> 07:35.900
I'm from Daizhou!

50
07:37.100 --> 07:38.020
I'm from Langzhong.

51
07:38.020 --> 07:38.780
I'm from Hannan.

52
07:38.780 --> 07:39.780
I'm from Hexi.

53
07:44.900 --> 07:45.940
I'm from Jiangnan!

54
07:58.260 --> 07:58.860
I'm from

55
07:59.620 --> 08:01.860
Santu County, Lingnan Circuit.

56
08:10.140 --> 08:11.980
All troops, hear my command!

57
08:12.460 --> 08:13.460
Here!

58
08:16.980 --> 08:17.820
Sally forth.

59
08:20.140 --> 08:22.500
Wipe out the enemy!

60
08:22.940 --> 08:24.220
Yes, sir!

61
09:19.900 --> 09:21.020
Kill!

62
10:11.700 --> 10:16.220
♪So many clever schemes with a fan's wave♪

63
10:17.060 --> 10:23.740
♪Standing with kindred spirits, united against our foes to bring an end to war♪

64
10:23.900 --> 10:28.900
♪Someday, we'll sail and feed the gulls♪

65
10:29.060 --> 10:34.420
♪Gaze upon the land and guard it with you♪

66
10:35.940 --> 10:41.980
♪Trading fine wine for a blade; dreaming beneath the moon in a tower♪

67
10:42.060 --> 10:48.100
♪I'd trade all the world's romance for one moment of tenderness♪

68
10:50.660 --> 10:54.980
♪Whose eyes have seen the smoke of war?♪

69
10:55.020 --> 10:58.260
♪I'll ride into battle♪

70
10:58.340 --> 11:02.340
♪Blood stains my sleeves as I stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

71
11:02.900 --> 11:07.140
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

72
11:07.340 --> 11:12.650
♪May you live a life free of sorrow; may the moon shine on us forever♪

73
11:12.650 --> 11:18.380
♪May you live a life free of sorrow; may the moon shine on us forever♪

74
11:27.500 --> 11:27.980
Mu Xun.

75
11:39.820 --> 11:40.420
You've lost.

76
12:01.820 --> 12:07.020
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

77
12:09.380 --> 12:10.300
Sheng'an is so close.

78
12:10.300 --> 12:11.060
Sheng'an is so close.

79
12:14.540 --> 12:15.940
Yet I could never return.

80
12:41.900 --> 12:42.340
I

81
12:44.300 --> 12:46.660
am the rightful heir of Huai!

82
12:47.180 --> 12:48.020
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

83
13:00.660 --> 13:02.060
I've earned my merit!

84
13:03.180 --> 13:04.740
I've earned my merit!

85
13:05.660 --> 13:08.020
I've earned my merit!

86
13:08.420 --> 13:10.620
I've earned my merit!

87
13:10.900 --> 13:12.500
I've earned my merit!

88
13:15.820 --> 13:17.020
Commander Yan! Commander Yan!

89
13:17.380 --> 13:17.940
Are you all right?

90
13:17.940 --> 13:18.540
Are you okay?

91
13:36.180 --> 13:36.700
(Your Highness.)

92
13:37.740 --> 13:39.100
(You haven't finished)

93
13:39.860 --> 13:40.700
(telling me your story.)

94
13:42.460 --> 13:43.460
(The ending)

95
13:44.340 --> 13:45.420
(wasn't anything special.)

96
13:47.500 --> 13:48.540
(The fire rose)

97
13:49.700 --> 13:51.420
(and burned them all to ashes.)

98
13:53.420 --> 13:54.620
(The wood ash and molten iron)

99
13:55.740 --> 13:57.340
(embraced in the earth,)

100
13:59.180 --> 14:00.060
(forging)

101
14:01.460 --> 14:02.860
(unbreakable steel.)

102
14:05.100 --> 14:08.720
♪Defy its might, and the submission it demands♪

103
14:08.720 --> 14:12.180
♪Defy its might, and the submission it demands♪

104
14:12.300 --> 14:15.940
♪Defy its scorn, stain the sky with blood♪

105
14:15.940 --> 14:19.460
♪Defy its scorn, stain the sky with blood♪

106
14:19.940 --> 14:23.940
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

107
14:24.020 --> 14:26.540
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

108
14:26.700 --> 14:30.220
♪Cold as a blade, yet peerless as a bloom♪

109
14:30.540 --> 14:34.060
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

110
14:34.100 --> 14:38.340
♪With sacrificed innocence and a soul snowbound♪

111
14:38.460 --> 14:40.980
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

112
14:41.060 --> 14:44.180
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

113
14:44.300 --> 14:47.420
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

114
14:48.100 --> 14:52.140
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

115
14:52.660 --> 14:55.460
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

116
14:55.500 --> 15:01.740
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers bright as day for you♪

117
15:02.420 --> 15:06.180
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

118
15:06.300 --> 15:09.380
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

119
15:11.220 --> 15:11.860
(Iron said,)

120
15:13.660 --> 15:14.260
("How wonderful.")

121
15:16.180 --> 15:17.260
("We've met again.")

122
15:19.540 --> 15:23.340
♪They gave me this life without asking me♪

123
15:23.820 --> 15:26.900
♪If I can't decide what to do with it♪

124
15:26.900 --> 15:33.260
♪I might as well use it to light a fire and burn the darkness into daylight♪

125
15:33.620 --> 15:37.420
♪You're my princess, and I'll take you away♪

126
15:37.540 --> 15:40.620
♪In this life, we'll bow only to flowers♪

127
15:40.860 --> 15:46.700
♪Fierce and radiant, red lips and dark eyes♪

128
15:46.980 --> 15:51.060
♪Together we'll climb the city walls♪

129
16:13.780 --> 16:15.540
(The young Emperor Chun ascended the throne.)

130
16:16.060 --> 16:18.860
(The Grand Princess Regent holds the reins of government.)

131
16:19.540 --> 16:22.220
(Yan Shang, Head of the Secretariat, leads the court.)

132
16:22.380 --> 16:23.580
(With ruler and ministers united,)

133
16:23.900 --> 16:26.580
(a golden age began.)

134
18:07.420 --> 18:14.100
(Three years later, Princess Danyang's Residence)

135
18:44.660 --> 18:45.380
(As a child,)

136
18:46.700 --> 18:48.620
(I used to imagine my wedding day.)

137
18:50.300 --> 18:50.980
(Later,)

138
18:52.220 --> 18:54.380
(I thought I'd never want to marry.)

139
19:15.500 --> 19:17.900
May you share a long and happy life, Head of the Secretariat!

140
19:18.060 --> 19:20.060
(I never thought I'd be lucky enough)

141
19:20.860 --> 19:22.220
(to marry her in this life.)

142
19:36.380 --> 19:37.060
Shang!

143
19:37.820 --> 19:38.660
Shang!

144
19:39.940 --> 19:40.740
Father, look at Shang.

145
19:44.380 --> 19:45.340
Isn't my brother handsome?

146
20:42.420 --> 20:43.740
The newlyweds bow to each other.

147
21:02.460 --> 21:03.900
The mirror knots are joined.

148
21:35.540 --> 21:36.860
The wedding cups are joined.

149
21:37.500 --> 21:38.700
May your love stay as true as ever.

150
22:14.540 --> 22:17.900
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

151
22:18.020 --> 22:21.580
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

152
22:21.700 --> 22:28.620
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world, let's return to when we first met♪

153
22:28.820 --> 22:30.700
♪- May time be free of fear - Boats rock♪

154
22:30.700 --> 22:33.340
♪- May time be free of pain - Lights fade, seasons turn♪

155
22:33.380 --> 22:35.940
♪You're the only one I need♪

156
22:35.980 --> 22:42.300
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

157
22:42.300 --> 22:43.540
Today, this joyous union is celebrated.

158
22:43.820 --> 22:45.060
Heaven and earth bear witness.

159
22:45.740 --> 22:46.540
The ceremony is complete.

160
22:46.620 --> 22:50.060
♪My last untouched innocence♪

161
22:50.380 --> 22:53.820
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

162
22:54.100 --> 22:57.500
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

163
22:57.660 --> 23:04.540
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

164
23:04.700 --> 23:06.580
♪- May time be free of fear - Boats rock♪

165
23:06.580 --> 23:09.220
♪- May time be free of pain - Lights fade, seasons turn♪

166
23:09.380 --> 23:11.900
♪You're the only one I need♪

167
23:11.940 --> 23:15.200
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

168
23:15.200 --> 23:19.100
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

169
23:19.180 --> 23:22.540
♪- Till fireworks flood the town - Till the lake is still and clear♪

170
23:22.620 --> 23:26.020
♪The wind blows past us♪

171
23:26.300 --> 23:30.940
♪- If there's still - Some warmth left in this world♪

172
23:31.660 --> 23:36.060
♪You're the only one I need♪

173
23:47.900 --> 23:52.820
(Yan Family, Lingnan)

174
24:22.740 --> 24:23.100
Look.

175
24:23.900 --> 24:25.260
That's how the rice grains come out.

176
24:27.700 --> 24:28.900
Rice really is falling out.

177
24:29.420 --> 24:30.220
Want to try, Si'er?

178
24:30.740 --> 24:31.100
Sure.

179
24:33.620 --> 24:34.340
Come over here.

180
24:35.700 --> 24:36.140
Hold it.

181
24:36.860 --> 24:37.900
One, two, three.

182
24:38.740 --> 24:39.020
Come on.

183
24:46.740 --> 24:46.980
Come on.

184
24:47.700 --> 24:48.500
Up. Down.

185
24:54.500 --> 24:55.980
See, the grains are all flying out.

186
24:57.060 --> 24:57.700
Let's take a break.

187
25:01.460 --> 25:03.140
Freshly peeled, Your Majesty. Nice and juicy.

188
25:03.260 --> 25:03.620
Try it.

189
25:08.980 --> 25:09.780
I can't bite through it.

190
25:11.260 --> 25:13.060
I'll make you sugarcane juice in a bit.

191
25:13.420 --> 25:14.820
once all your permanent teeth come in,

192
25:15.260 --> 25:16.740
you'll be able to bite through it quickly and easily.

193
25:20.500 --> 25:21.260
Sir,

194
25:21.860 --> 25:24.140
is this the rice we usually eat?

195
25:24.500 --> 25:26.260
It doesn't look quite the same.

196
25:27.540 --> 25:28.260
We're far from done.

197
25:29.100 --> 25:30.100
Once the rice ears are threshed,

198
25:30.620 --> 25:31.540
they still need to be spread out

199
25:32.100 --> 25:33.020
to winnow off the husks.

200
25:33.460 --> 25:34.700
Then milling and pounding.

201
25:34.940 --> 25:36.740
Sifting out the chaff and grinding off the bran.

202
25:37.300 --> 25:39.100
Only then can it be cooked and served

203
25:39.460 --> 25:40.540
at your table, Your Majesty.

204
25:40.980 --> 25:42.300
That's a lot of work.

205
25:42.860 --> 25:44.620
There's even more work before threshing.

206
25:45.060 --> 25:46.980
You have to plow the fields, sow the seeds,

207
25:47.300 --> 25:49.460
transplant the seedlings, channel the water, and pull the weeds.

208
25:50.020 --> 25:51.500
You have to work until the grain ripens.

209
25:51.940 --> 25:54.300
Only then can you thresh and dry it, just as we're doing now.

210
25:57.700 --> 25:59.500
Last month, you asked me

211
25:59.780 --> 26:01.860
what the ministers always mean

212
26:02.220 --> 26:03.300
by "Sheji."

213
26:03.700 --> 26:04.180
I told you

214
26:04.660 --> 26:06.700
that "She" is the god of the land,

215
26:07.180 --> 26:07.940
who nurtures all things.

216
26:08.580 --> 26:10.540
"Ji" is the god of grain,

217
26:11.100 --> 26:12.020
who feeds the people.

218
26:13.260 --> 26:15.380
So "Sheji"

219
26:15.900 --> 26:18.380
means the gods who protect our land and crops?

220
26:18.940 --> 26:19.620
No.

221
26:20.420 --> 26:21.940
The gods can't grow grain.

222
26:22.420 --> 26:22.980
Aunt!

223
26:26.580 --> 26:28.140
Gods don't plow a single field,

224
26:28.420 --> 26:29.180
don't weave a chi of cloth,

225
26:29.940 --> 26:31.540
and certainly don't guard the borders for us.

226
26:32.860 --> 26:34.900
Si'er, who truly grows

227
26:35.340 --> 26:36.300
our crops

228
26:36.620 --> 26:36.980
and protects our land?

229
26:42.580 --> 26:43.220
It's the people.

230
26:43.740 --> 26:44.900
I saw them all along the way.

231
26:45.220 --> 26:46.980
Commoners working in the fields.

232
26:47.380 --> 26:49.020
Women weaving cloth in the villages.

233
26:49.340 --> 26:51.620
So many soldiers guarding the city walls.

234
26:59.660 --> 27:00.460
Xiaozhou, you're back.

235
27:00.580 --> 27:01.380
Where are Father and Dalang?

236
27:01.700 --> 27:02.380
Still at the charity school?

237
27:02.980 --> 27:05.260
Don't even ask. Father sent me back to fetch the ruler.

238
27:05.820 --> 27:07.180
He was teaching the children to recite today

239
27:07.180 --> 27:08.340
and got furious.

240
27:08.500 --> 27:08.860
He shouted,

241
27:09.300 --> 27:11.260
"How dumb can one be not to memorize the Thousand Character Classic?"

242
27:11.580 --> 27:13.220
Dalang was too scared to say a word.

243
27:15.540 --> 27:17.500
Aunt, what's a charity school?

244
27:19.140 --> 27:19.620
Xiaozhou.

245
27:20.820 --> 27:22.740
Could you take Si'er to see the charity school?

246
27:23.380 --> 27:23.740
Sure.

247
27:24.580 --> 27:25.900
Can I come too?

248
27:26.500 --> 27:27.060
I...

249
27:27.660 --> 27:28.660
I can recite the Thousand Character Classic.

250
27:29.380 --> 27:29.700
Let's go.

251
27:30.580 --> 27:30.980
Go ahead.

252
27:30.980 --> 27:31.300
Go on.

253
27:32.180 --> 27:32.620
Come on, Si'er.

254
27:46.820 --> 27:47.500
Head of the Secretariat.

255
27:48.100 --> 27:48.420
Come here.

256
27:53.260 --> 27:53.700
Your Highness.

257
28:28.020 --> 28:29.420
I haven't walked far,

258
28:30.060 --> 28:31.260
but I'm already exhausted.

259
28:34.300 --> 28:35.620
I'll take you back to rest,

260
28:36.500 --> 28:37.220
Your Highness.

261
29:03.300 --> 29:04.660
Your Highness, what would you like for dinner?

262
29:06.100 --> 29:07.460
When in Rome.

263
29:07.780 --> 29:08.460
We'll eat

264
29:08.460 --> 29:09.380
whatever they have here.

265
29:14.220 --> 29:14.940
Look.

266
29:15.500 --> 29:16.580
The book says

267
29:16.980 --> 29:19.100
besides lychee wine,

268
29:19.780 --> 29:20.620
Lingnan also has green plums.

269
29:21.700 --> 29:23.380
So green plum wine?

270
29:26.220 --> 29:27.900
And some cured meat from here.

271
29:28.900 --> 29:29.460
All right then.

272
30:49.340 --> 30:51.460
Harvest in autumn, store for winter.

273
30:55.980 --> 30:56.980
Fruit wine.

274
30:57.380 --> 30:58.060
Want to try some?

275
30:58.620 --> 30:59.100
A bit sour.

276
30:59.380 --> 30:59.940
But it's fine.

277
31:02.180 --> 31:06.100
♪Where endless time comes to an end♪

278
31:06.100 --> 31:10.340
♪Moonlight and breeze fill our boat home♪

279
31:10.420 --> 31:14.520
♪Golden winds and jade dew return♪

280
31:14.520 --> 31:18.940
♪The world still blooms as before♪

281
31:19.060 --> 31:23.120
♪How lucky to roam with you♪

282
31:23.120 --> 31:27.260
♪Back to the road where it all began♪

283
31:27.780 --> 31:32.020
♪As if our youthful hearts remain♪

284
31:32.100 --> 31:36.180
♪As if our love will never fade♪

285
31:36.300 --> 31:43.020
♪Chasing clouds by boat, carefree and unbound♪

286
31:54.140 --> 31:54.580
This fish

287
31:55.220 --> 31:55.940
looks delicious.

288
31:56.460 --> 31:57.220
Have some of this big fish.

289
31:57.900 --> 31:58.780
How about a bite?

290
31:58.780 --> 31:59.180
Here, Shang.

291
31:59.340 --> 31:59.780
Want to try?

292
32:00.580 --> 32:01.420
Let's have a drink together.

293
32:02.980 --> 32:04.460
First, a toast to Wanyao.

294
32:05.740 --> 32:06.060
Wanyao.

295
32:07.020 --> 32:07.580
A toast to you.

296
32:12.460 --> 32:13.180
I'll drink tea instead.

297
32:13.940 --> 32:14.340
Here.

298
32:17.860 --> 32:18.340
Come on.

299
32:18.660 --> 32:19.500
- Shang, Wanyao. - Dig in.

300
32:19.700 --> 32:21.100
Is the food to your liking?

301
32:21.500 --> 32:22.020
Delicious.

302
32:22.540 --> 32:23.780
This is a Lingnan specialty,

303
32:23.980 --> 32:25.140
pork offal soup with amomum.

304
32:25.340 --> 32:26.100
Be sure to have some.

305
32:26.620 --> 32:26.900
Wanyao,

306
32:27.300 --> 32:27.940
let me get you a bowl.

307
32:35.300 --> 32:35.620
Try it.

308
32:38.260 --> 32:38.780
It smells wonderful.

309
32:40.860 --> 32:42.900
Do you remember when we first met,

310
32:42.900 --> 32:44.220
and you pinned me down?

311
32:44.500 --> 32:45.020
Remember?

312
32:45.020 --> 32:45.780
Let's not bring that up.

313
32:46.300 --> 32:46.820
Let this drink

314
32:47.020 --> 32:47.980
be my apology.

315
32:48.420 --> 32:49.580
When you come to Sheng'an someday,

316
32:49.820 --> 32:52.020
I'll show you its fine food and wine

317
32:52.260 --> 32:52.900
and its bustling sights.

318
32:53.340 --> 32:53.660
Bottoms up.

319
32:54.180 --> 32:55.220
You'd better keep your word.

320
32:58.860 --> 32:59.500
Of course.

321
32:59.900 --> 33:00.380
Bottoms up!

322
33:01.380 --> 33:03.860
When we sat for the imperial exams,

323
33:04.380 --> 33:05.100
Sheng'an

324
33:06.380 --> 33:07.340
was nothing

325
33:07.340 --> 33:09.220
like the place you describe today.

326
33:10.620 --> 33:12.260
What was Sheng'an like back then?

327
33:12.620 --> 33:13.900
What changed it?

328
33:17.180 --> 33:19.260
That is

329
33:20.940 --> 33:21.980
a very long story.

330
33:58.020 --> 33:58.500
Good thing.

331
34:00.100 --> 34:00.780
We didn't miss it.

332
34:05.620 --> 34:06.180
Good thing.

333
34:07.260 --> 34:08.220
We didn't miss each other.

334
34:09.820 --> 34:10.940
How could we ever miss each other?

335
34:12.020 --> 34:14.460
You're the only one of your kind in this world.

336
34:15.420 --> 34:16.820
I won't let you go so easily.

337
34:18.460 --> 34:18.900
That's right.

338
34:19.980 --> 34:21.100
We were meant to be together.

339
34:22.100 --> 34:23.140
Together, we'll ascend to the highest heavens.

340
34:24.020 --> 34:25.100
Together, we'll descend to the deepest hell.

341
34:26.460 --> 34:27.820
Together, we'll be immortal lovers.

342
34:28.540 --> 34:30.860
Together, we'll be vengeful demons.

343
34:42.260 --> 34:44.060
Back then, when I was lost in the mountains,

344
34:44.940 --> 34:45.700
everything

345
34:46.300 --> 34:48.740
seemed terrifying. Danger lurked at every turn.

346
34:50.380 --> 34:51.860
Now, so much time has passed.

347
34:52.620 --> 34:53.460
Looking back,

348
34:54.020 --> 34:55.140
it all seems like a beautiful painting.

349
34:56.780 --> 34:57.300
Yan Shang.

350
34:57.900 --> 34:59.220
Were you

351
35:00.060 --> 35:01.940
ever afraid when you first came

352
35:02.540 --> 35:03.500
to the mountains of Lingnan?

353
35:07.660 --> 35:08.900
At first, I didn't dare walk alone.

354
35:09.900 --> 35:11.780
Any sound or movement

355
35:13.140 --> 35:13.860
startled me.

356
35:15.100 --> 35:15.700
Later,

357
35:16.300 --> 35:17.380
I stopped being afraid.

358
35:18.140 --> 35:19.220
I traveled to and from my studies every day.

359
35:19.700 --> 35:21.020
The mountains changed with the seasons.

360
35:23.260 --> 35:24.580
There was endless scenery to take in.

361
35:43.580 --> 35:44.500
You brought me wine?

362
35:46.220 --> 35:48.780
With such fine weather, beautiful scenery, and so much free time,

363
35:49.260 --> 35:49.940
how could we go without wine?

364
35:50.900 --> 35:51.940
The lychee harvest was good this year.

365
35:52.220 --> 35:53.260
Xiaozhou brewed a few extra jars.

366
35:53.940 --> 35:54.820
Enough for you to take back

367
35:55.540 --> 35:56.100
and drink for a while.

368
35:57.020 --> 35:57.820
Strange.

369
35:58.420 --> 35:59.460
Back in the palace,

370
35:59.940 --> 36:02.020
you'd always find a way

371
36:02.500 --> 36:03.580
to talk me into drinking less.

372
36:05.580 --> 36:06.660
This is Lingnan.

373
36:07.740 --> 36:08.660
I have a selfish reason.

374
36:10.460 --> 36:11.020
Really?

375
36:11.940 --> 36:14.980
Even the most upright and proper Head of the Secretariat in all of Huai

376
36:15.980 --> 36:17.340
has a selfish side?

377
36:21.380 --> 36:22.060
I hope

378
36:22.660 --> 36:23.380
that at least here,

379
36:24.140 --> 36:25.580
you can do as you please and enjoy yourself.

380
36:26.300 --> 36:27.380
If you want to drink, then drink.

381
36:27.900 --> 36:28.420
If you get drunk,

382
36:29.140 --> 36:30.500
sleep till the sun's high.

383
36:38.020 --> 36:39.180
We need

384
36:40.020 --> 36:42.260
a few days like this now and then.

385
36:43.180 --> 36:44.220
That gives us the strength

386
36:45.140 --> 36:46.300
to keep working.

387
36:52.140 --> 36:53.180
Actually,

388
36:53.940 --> 36:55.020
when I woke

389
36:55.620 --> 36:56.660
from my nap that day,

390
36:57.980 --> 36:59.340
for a little while,

391
37:00.220 --> 37:02.460
I couldn't remember what day it was

392
37:02.900 --> 37:03.860
or where I was.

393
37:05.500 --> 37:07.980
It was as if I'd just been sleeping in the palace study

394
37:08.500 --> 37:09.900
piled with memorials,

395
37:11.220 --> 37:12.020
or

396
37:12.580 --> 37:14.180
in the lofty tower of my residence.

397
37:15.260 --> 37:15.860
Then

398
37:16.700 --> 37:18.940
I remembered I was in Lingnan.

399
37:19.540 --> 37:21.100
I was so happy.

400
37:26.420 --> 37:27.220
Tomorrow,

401
37:28.420 --> 37:29.900
it's time to head back to Sheng'an.

402
37:33.380 --> 37:33.900
Do you

403
37:34.660 --> 37:35.740
want to delay our return?

404
37:36.460 --> 37:37.340
Of course not.

405
37:38.380 --> 37:39.300
We haven't exactly been idle

406
37:39.820 --> 37:40.860
on this trip.

407
37:41.540 --> 37:42.300
Who knows

408
37:42.620 --> 37:44.340
how much work will be waiting for us back there.

409
37:45.540 --> 37:47.140
Winter is only a few months away.

410
37:47.780 --> 37:48.620
I wonder

411
37:48.980 --> 37:50.580
if Longyou's granaries are fully stocked.

412
37:51.260 --> 37:53.700
The envoy from the Caliphate arrives early next month.

413
37:54.300 --> 37:55.580
The Court of State Ceremonial will be busy.

414
37:56.180 --> 37:57.500
The records from the Bureau of Evaluations

415
37:57.700 --> 37:58.860
should be arriving this year too.

416
37:59.020 --> 38:00.140
- All right. - And...

417
38:04.420 --> 38:05.260
Tomorrow

418
38:07.020 --> 38:08.020
is another day.

419
38:09.900 --> 38:14.780
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing across your brow♪

420
38:16.940 --> 38:22.300
♪Let me hold you whenever the rain falls♪

421
38:22.420 --> 38:27.020
♪- Together we'll soar to the skies - Together we'll turn to ashes♪

422
38:27.020 --> 38:32.300
♪- Burning bright as a song - Two shadows entwined, a beautiful sight♪

423
38:32.380 --> 38:37.380
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

424
38:37.420 --> 38:42.220
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

425
38:42.260 --> 38:44.100
♪Not a single hour less♪

426
38:44.140 --> 38:47.940
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

427
38:47.940 --> 38:51.900
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

428
38:52.020 --> 38:55.340
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

429
38:55.500 --> 38:58.980
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

430
38:59.220 --> 39:05.980
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world, let's return to when we first met♪

431
39:06.340 --> 39:08.180
♪- May time be free of fear - Boats rock♪

432
39:08.180 --> 39:10.740
♪- May time be free of pain - Lights fade, seasons turn♪

433
39:10.900 --> 39:13.300
♪You're the only one I need♪

434
39:13.460 --> 39:17.100
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

435
39:17.100 --> 39:20.580
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

436
39:20.660 --> 39:23.980
♪- Be my one and only in this world - Be my one and only in this life♪

437
39:24.100 --> 39:25.940
♪My last untouched innocence♪

438
39:25.940 --> 39:27.460
Thus, Heaven does not speak.

439
39:28.100 --> 39:30.380
It shows its will through deeds and actions.

440
39:31.420 --> 39:32.580
One might ask,

441
39:33.220 --> 39:35.740
"Recommend a man to Heaven, and Heaven accepts him."

442
39:36.380 --> 39:39.180
"Reveal him to the people, and the people accept him."

443
39:39.460 --> 39:40.020
"How so?"

444
39:42.980 --> 39:43.460
How so?

445
39:45.100 --> 39:47.020
Mother, you drifted off again.

446
39:47.780 --> 39:48.820
I'm listening.

447
39:49.100 --> 39:49.780
Go on.

448
39:50.460 --> 39:53.060
What did the passage I just recited mean?

449
39:54.300 --> 39:56.380
It means...

450
40:00.860 --> 40:01.660
I don't know.

451
40:02.340 --> 40:04.420
I already explained it to you last time.

452
40:05.140 --> 40:06.060
I forgot.

453
40:07.300 --> 40:08.460
Aunt.

454
40:10.620 --> 40:11.820
I have things to attend to.

455
40:12.420 --> 40:13.620
You'd better study hard.

456
40:15.540 --> 40:16.620
Your Highness, don't go!

457
40:17.060 --> 40:17.900
You're not staying with me?

458
40:19.220 --> 40:20.940
Mother, pay attention.

459
40:22.140 --> 40:22.860
I am listening.

460
40:30.540 --> 40:31.540
Are you fleeing for your life?

461
40:32.820 --> 40:34.700
Si'er is teaching Chunhua the Mencius.

462
40:34.900 --> 40:36.140
And he insists I supervise.

463
40:36.940 --> 40:38.540
With the little learning Chunhua has,

464
40:39.020 --> 40:40.140
how could she possibly understand it?

465
40:40.940 --> 40:43.300
Si'er is nearly in tears from frustration.

466
40:43.780 --> 40:45.180
So I had to sneak away.

467
40:46.980 --> 40:48.140
If His Majesty dares to teach it,

468
40:48.820 --> 40:50.900
he must have learned it thoroughly himself.

469
40:52.100 --> 40:53.340
You taught Si'er

470
40:53.740 --> 40:55.220
the Mencius yourself, Scholar Yan.

471
40:55.980 --> 40:56.740
How could he not know it well?

472
41:00.420 --> 41:01.460
So many poems and essays.

473
41:03.460 --> 41:05.620
Are these all this year's scholars' portfolios?

474
41:06.500 --> 41:06.900
Yes.

475
41:08.780 --> 41:09.900
Any promising talents?

476
41:11.500 --> 41:12.540
Their scholarship is solid,

477
41:13.340 --> 41:14.500
but they need further deliberation.

478
41:16.860 --> 41:17.900
Consider them carefully.

479
41:19.180 --> 41:19.820
Of course.

480
41:20.740 --> 41:21.780
Stop talking to me now.

481
41:22.020 --> 41:23.260
I have so many memorials to read.

482
42:16.060 --> 42:17.100
The roads are slippery in the snow.

483
42:18.020 --> 42:19.060
We'll have to get up early

484
42:20.180 --> 42:21.220
for court tomorrow.

485
42:24.700 --> 42:25.380
I'll wake you.

486
42:41.940 --> 42:42.780
(Yan Shang and I)

487
42:43.460 --> 42:44.860
(once agreed we'd retire together.)

488
42:46.060 --> 42:47.220
(But the wilds, for all their beauty,)

489
42:47.980 --> 42:48.820
(are not where my heart lies.)

490
42:50.500 --> 42:51.060
(Sheng'an)

491
42:51.820 --> 42:52.620
(is my home)

492
42:53.700 --> 42:54.580
(and my battlefield.)

493
42:56.140 --> 42:57.260
(I will stay here,)

494
42:58.500 --> 42:59.940
(with Go and sword,)

495
43:00.780 --> 43:01.500
(till my last breath.)

496
43:03.300 --> 43:04.060
(No need to turn back.)

497
43:05.340 --> 43:06.140
(Just lift my eyes,)

498
43:07.300 --> 43:08.860
(and he's there beside me.)

499
43:09.780 --> 43:10.620
(We stand side by side.)

500
43:13.460 --> 43:14.100
(Together,)

501
43:15.580 --> 43:16.340
(we protect our city)

502
43:17.780 --> 43:18.580
(and help our nation thrive.)

503
43:21.100 --> 43:22.220
(A life well spent.)

504
44:00.620 --> 44:07.520
(The End)

505
44:10.360 --> 44:13.653
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

506
44:16.338 --> 44:21.254
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

507
44:23.448 --> 44:29.293
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

508
44:29.793 --> 44:35.019
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

509
44:37.788 --> 44:42.579
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

510
44:43.415 --> 44:49.494
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

511
44:51.295 --> 44:54.445
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

512
44:54.445 --> 44:56.093
♪Burning bright as a song♪

513
44:56.145 --> 44:59.869
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

514
45:00.247 --> 45:04.913
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

515
45:05.532 --> 45:09.573
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

516
45:10.064 --> 45:12.179
♪Not a single hour less♪

517
45:12.219 --> 45:19.165
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

518
45:19.928 --> 45:23.381
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

519
45:23.561 --> 45:26.706
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

520
45:27.145 --> 45:33.782
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

521
45:34.179 --> 45:36.217
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

522
45:36.217 --> 45:38.693
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

523
45:38.731 --> 45:41.200
♪You're the only one I need♪

524
45:41.404 --> 45:48.291
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

525
45:48.603 --> 45:51.874
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

526
45:52.179 --> 45:55.352
♪My last untouched innocence♪

527
45:55.676 --> 45:59.102
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

528
45:59.335 --> 46:02.560
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

529
46:02.891 --> 46:09.687
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

530
46:10.056 --> 46:12.118
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

531
46:12.119 --> 46:14.622
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

532
46:14.669 --> 46:17.007
♪You're the only one I need♪

533
46:17.238 --> 46:24.073
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

534
46:24.422 --> 46:26.040
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

535
46:26.170 --> 46:27.966
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

536
46:28.323 --> 46:31.340
♪You're the only one I need♪

537
46:31.380 --> 46:32.707
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
